{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49008","headline":"石笋 · 刘昭禹","name":"石笋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千古海门石，移归吟叟居。\n窍腥蛟出後，形瘦浪冲余。\n工语宁无玉，僧知忽有书。\n好期仙者叱，变化向庭隅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘昭禹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}